  },
  "content": [
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Launcelet and Jessica."
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "launcelet",
        "name": "LAUNCELET",
        "displayName": "Launcelet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Yes, truly, for look you, the sins of the father are to be laid upon the children, therefore, I promise you, I fear you. I was always plain with you, and so now I speak my agitation of the matter. Therefore be of good cheer, for truly I think you are damn'd. There is but one hope in it that can do you any good, and that is but a kind of bastard hope neither.",
          "plainText": "Yes truly for look you the sins of the father are to be laid upon the children therefore I promise you I fear you I was always plain with you and so now I speak my agitation of the matter Therefore be of good cheer for truly I think you are damn'd There is but one hope in it that can do you any good and that is but a kind of bastard hope neither",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "jessica",
        "name": "JESSICA",
        "displayName": "Jessica"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "And what hope is that, I pray thee?",
          "plainText": "And what hope is that I pray thee",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "launcelet",
        "name": "LAUNCELET",
        "displayName": "Launcelet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Marry, you may partly hope that your father got you not, that you are not the Jew's daughter.",
          "plainText": "Marry you may partly hope that your father got you not that you are not the Jew's daughter",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-004",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "jessica",
        "name": "JESSICA",
        "displayName": "Jessica"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "That were a kind of bastard hope indeed; so the sins of my mother should be visited upon me.",
          "plainText": "That were a kind of bastard hope indeed so the sins of my mother should be visited upon me",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-005",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "launcelet",
        "name": "LAUNCELET",
        "displayName": "Launcelet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Truly then I fear you are damn'd both by father and mother; thus when I shun Scylla your father, I fall into Charybdis your mother. Well, you are gone both ways.",
          "plainText": "Truly then I fear you are damn'd both by father and mother thus when I shun Scylla your father I fall into Charybdis your mother Well you are gone both ways",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-006",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "jessica",
        "name": "JESSICA",
        "displayName": "Jessica"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I shall be saved by my husband. He hath made me a Christian.",
          "plainText": "I shall be saved by my husband He hath made me a Christian",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-007",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "launcelet",
        "name": "LAUNCELET",
        "displayName": "Launcelet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Truly the more to blame he, we were Christians enow before, e'en as many as could well live one by another. This making of Christians will raise the price of hogs; if we grow all to be pork-eaters, we shall not shortly have a rasher on the coals for money.",
          "plainText": "Truly the more to blame he we were Christians enow before e'en as many as could well live one by another This making of Christians will raise the price of hogs if we grow all to be porkeaters we shall not shortly have a rasher on the coals for money",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Lorenzo."
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-008",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "jessica",
        "name": "JESSICA",
        "displayName": "Jessica"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I'll tell my husband, Launcelet, what you say. Here he comes.",
          "plainText": "I'll tell my husband Launcelet what you say Here he comes",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-009",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lorenzo",
        "name": "LORENZO",
        "displayName": "Lorenzo"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I shall grow jealous of you shortly, Launcelet, if you thus get my wife into corners!",
          "plainText": "I shall grow jealous of you shortly Launcelet if you thus get my wife into corners",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-010",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "jessica",
        "name": "JESSICA",
        "displayName": "Jessica"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Nay, you need not fear us, Lorenzo. Launcelet and I are out. He tells me flatly there's no mercy for me in heaven, because I am a Jew's daughter; and he says you are no good member of the commonwealth, for in converting Jews to Christians you raise the price of pork.",
          "plainText": "Nay you need not fear us Lorenzo Launcelet and I are out He tells me flatly there's no mercy for me in heaven because I am a Jew's daughter and he says you are no good member of the commonwealth for in converting Jews to Christians you raise the price of pork",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-011",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lorenzo",
        "name": "LORENZO",
        "displayName": "Lorenzo"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I shall answer that better to the commonwealth than you can the getting up of the negro's belly! The Moor is with child by you, Launcelet.",
          "plainText": "I shall answer that better to the commonwealth than you can the getting up of the negro's belly The Moor is with child by you Launcelet",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-012",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "launcelet",
        "name": "LAUNCELET",
        "displayName": "Launcelet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "It is much that the Moor should be more than reason; but if she be less than an honest woman, she is indeed more than I took her for.",
          "plainText": "It is much that the Moor should be more than reason but if she be less than an honest woman she is indeed more than I took her for",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-013",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lorenzo",
        "name": "LORENZO",
        "displayName": "Lorenzo"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "How every fool can play upon the word! I think the best grace of wit will shortly turn into silence, and discourse grow commendable in none only but parrots. Go in, sirrah; bid them prepare for dinner.",
          "plainText": "How every fool can play upon the word I think the best grace of wit will shortly turn into silence and discourse grow commendable in none only but parrots Go in sirrah bid them prepare for dinner",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-014",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "launcelet",
        "name": "LAUNCELET",
        "displayName": "Launcelet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "That is done, sir, they have all stomachs.",
          "plainText": "That is done sir they have all stomachs",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-015",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lorenzo",
        "name": "LORENZO",
        "displayName": "Lorenzo"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0015",
          "number": 15,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Goodly Lord, what a wit-snapper are you! Then bid them prepare dinner.",
          "plainText": "Goodly Lord what a witsnapper are you Then bid them prepare dinner",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-016",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "launcelet",
        "name": "LAUNCELET",
        "displayName": "Launcelet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0016",
          "number": 16,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "That is done too, sir, only \"cover\" is the word.",
          "plainText": "That is done too sir only cover is the word",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-017",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lorenzo",
        "name": "LORENZO",
        "displayName": "Lorenzo"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0017",
          "number": 17,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Will you cover, then, sir?",
          "plainText": "Will you cover then sir",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-018",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "launcelet",
        "name": "LAUNCELET",
        "displayName": "Launcelet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0018",
          "number": 18,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Not so, sir, neither. I know my duty.",
          "plainText": "Not so sir neither I know my duty",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-019",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lorenzo",
        "name": "LORENZO",
        "displayName": "Lorenzo"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0019",
          "number": 19,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Yet more quarrelling with occasion! Wilt thou show the whole wealth of thy wit in an instant? I pray thee understand a plain man in his plain meaning: go to thy fellows, bid them cover the table, serve in the meat, and we will come in to dinner.",
          "plainText": "Yet more quarrelling with occasion Wilt thou show the whole wealth of thy wit in an instant I pray thee understand a plain man in his plain meaning go to thy fellows bid them cover the table serve in the meat and we will come in to dinner",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-020",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "launcelet",
        "name": "LAUNCELET",
        "displayName": "Launcelet"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0020",
          "number": 20,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "For the table, sir, it shall be served in; for the meat, sir, it shall be covered; for your coming in to dinner, sir, why, let it be as humours and conceits shall govern.",
          "plainText": "For the table sir it shall be served in for the meat sir it shall be covered for your coming in to dinner sir why let it be as humours and conceits shall govern",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-stage-003",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exit.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-021",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "lorenzo",
        "name": "LORENZO",
        "displayName": "Lorenzo"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0021",
          "number": 21,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "O dear discretion, how his words are suited!",
          "plainText": "O dear discretion how his words are suited",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0022",
          "number": 22,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "The fool hath planted in his memory",
          "plainText": "The fool hath planted in his memory",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0023",
          "number": 23,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "An army of good words, and I do know",
          "plainText": "An army of good words and I do know",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0024",
          "number": 24,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "A many fools that stand in better place,",
          "plainText": "A many fools that stand in better place",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0025",
          "number": 25,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Garnish'd like him, that for a tricksy word",
          "plainText": "Garnish'd like him that for a tricksy word",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0026",
          "number": 26,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "Defy the matter. How cheer'st thou, Jessica?",
          "plainText": "Defy the matter How cheer'st thou Jessica",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0027",
          "number": 27,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "And now, good sweet, say thy opinion,",
          "plainText": "And now good sweet say thy opinion",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0028",
          "number": 28,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "How dost thou like the Lord Bassanio's wife?",
          "plainText": "How dost thou like the Lord Bassanio's wife",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-speech-022",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "jessica",
        "name": "JESSICA",
        "displayName": "Jessica"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0029",
          "number": 29,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Past all expressing. It is very meet",
          "plainText": "Past all expressing It is very meet",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0030",
          "number": 30,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "The Lord Bassanio live an upright life,",
          "plainText": "The Lord Bassanio live an upright life",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0031",
          "number": 31,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "For having such a blessing in his lady,",
          "plainText": "For having such a blessing in his lady",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0032",
          "number": 32,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "He finds the joys of heaven here on earth,",
          "plainText": "He finds the joys of heaven here on earth",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0033",
          "number": 33,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "And if on earth he do not merit it,",
          "plainText": "And if on earth he do not merit it",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0034",
          "number": 34,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "In reason he should never come to heaven.",
          "plainText": "In reason he should never come to heaven",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "the-merchant-of-venice-3-5-line-0035",
          "number": 35,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "Why, if two gods should play some heavenly match,",
          "plainText": "Why if two gods should play some heavenly match",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
